        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Tinny Aims High</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/47036.webp" alt="Tinny Aims High" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p>[vc_row][vc_column width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7859&#8243; img_size=&#8221;medium&#8221;][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][vc_column_text]</p>
<h3><strong>Keep Tinny Primed</strong></h3>
<div>Make sure Tinny&#8217;s rocket-boosters are fully primed to collect <strong>Matching Funds</strong> that <strong>lift all of Teton Valley&#8217;s nonprofits</strong> to achieve their critical missions for the benefit of local residents, wildlife, and lands. The <strong>Community Foundation of Teton Valley</strong> hosts and <strong>continues to grow</strong> the Challenger Fund so all nonprofits can <strong>reach for the stars</strong>. Be sure there&#8217;s a <strong>solid Foundation</strong> to launch from —
<p>[/vc_column_text][dt_default_button border_radius=&#8221;6px&#8221; border_width=&#8221;0px&#8221; button_alignment=&#8221;btn_center&#8221; button_padding=&#8221;12px 18px 11px 18px&#8221; default_btn_bg_color=&#8221;#aa2323&#8243; font_size=&#8221;15&#8243; icon_size=&#8221;15&#8243; link=&#8221;url:https%3A%2F%2Fcfjh.iphiview.com%2Fcfjh%2FDonorView%2FAccountInformation%2Ftabid%2F495%2Fdispatch%2Faccountselection_id%2410906_hash%241c0c71b9a8078a604dbdfa2c94b19b5566a479d2%2FDefault.aspx||target:%20_blank|&#8221; size=&#8221;custom&#8221;]Donate Now![/dt_default_button][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]Our unique fundraising model balances the Challenger Fund and Designated Donations carefully to ensure that participating nonprofits get the most benefits from funds raised. Both ways of giving are <strong>equally important</strong> to this model. <strong>Designated Gifts</strong> provide operational funds that help ensure staff capacity and longevity. <strong>Challenger funds</strong> provide a partial Matching Grant, Competitive Grants, Youth Philanthropy grants, and Workshops that help advance the missions of local nonprofits. Additionally, the Challenger Fund covers Event Day costs and payment processing &#8211; meaning that participating nonprofits get <strong>100% of gifts</strong> designated to them.[/vc_column_text][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7860&#8243; img_size=&#8221;medium&#8221;][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7861&#8243; img_size=&#8221;medium&#8221;][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner][vc_column_text]At the Community Foundation, we understand the need to keep up with the <strong>55% increase in designated gifts</strong> we&#8217;ve seen since the inception of the Tin Cup Challenge in 2008. Taking note of the <strong>consistent increase in participation</strong> is why our nonprofit continues to grow the Challenger Fund and our organization. Increased capacity at the Community Foundation means <strong>more support</strong> for all of Teton Valley&#8217;s nonprofits.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7862&#8243; img_size=&#8221;medium&#8221;][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7863&#8243; img_size=&#8221;medium&#8221;][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]The <strong>Tin Cup Challenge</strong> is unique in another way. All Tin Cup funds are meant to be spent within <strong>18 months</strong> and within <strong>Teton Valley</strong>. This means a direct, instant infiltration into our community &#8211; year after year &#8211; to advance the critical missions of our nonprofits and <strong>benefit our entire community</strong>.[/vc_column_text][vc_separator][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][vc_column_text]</p>
<h3><strong>Community Counts!</strong></h3>
<div>Tinny is one busy cup &#8211; collecting donations from <strong>Business &amp; Community Challengers</strong>, processing donations from over <strong>1,000 donors</strong> during the Giving Period, and promoting the <strong>Tin Cup Challenge</strong> &amp; <strong>participating nonprofits</strong>, all while planning and executing our extraordinary <strong>Event Day</strong>. Consider supporting Tinny&#8217;s efforts with a <strong>direct donation</strong> to the <strong>Community Foundation.</strong>
<p>[/vc_column_text][dt_default_button border_radius=&#8221;6px&#8221; border_width=&#8221;0px&#8221; button_alignment=&#8221;btn_center&#8221; button_padding=&#8221;12px 18px 11px 18px&#8221; default_btn_bg_color=&#8221;#aa2323&#8243; font_size=&#8221;15&#8243; icon_size=&#8221;15&#8243; link=&#8221;url:https%3A%2F%2Fcfjh.iphiview.com%2Fcfjh%2FDonorView%2FAccountInformation%2Ftabid%2F495%2Fdispatch%2Faccountselection_id%2410906_hash%241c0c71b9a8078a604dbdfa2c94b19b5566a479d2%2FDefault.aspx||target:%20_blank|&#8221; size=&#8221;custom&#8221;]Donate Today![/dt_default_button][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7864&#8243; img_size=&#8221;medium&#8221;][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_separator][vc_column_text]</p>
